OL,3,GNEWSAArtist calls for cleaner Thames
OL,4,Awith exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey artist is using an exhibition
OL,7,Fto call for the government's Clean
OL,8,FWater Bill to be strengthened in a bid
OL,9,Fto make the River Thames cleaner.
OL,11,FRory Maguire, from Weybridge, is
OL,12,Fhosting an exhibition on the towpath by
OL,13,FElmbridge Canoe Club on Saturday to
OL,14,Fhighlight the "ongoing sewage crisis
OL,15,Fplaguing the River Thames".
OL,17,FThe exhibition is part of a nationwide
OL,18,Fpush from charity Surfers Against
OL,19,FSewage.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
