OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArtist calls for cleaner Thames
OL,4,Awith exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,7,FRural Affairs (Defra) said: "Our
OL,8,Fstrengthened Water Bill will deliver
OL,9,Fcleaner waters, give new powers to
OL,10,Fmayors to hold water companies [to]
OL,11,Faccount and will create a powerful new
OL,12,Fregulator so that companies can deliver
OL,13,Ffor customers and the environment."
